{%- comment -%}
  BBC product card. Uses real Shopify product data, with the editorial design
  preserved. Falls back to a coloured "tone" placeholder when a product has no
  image yet.

  Parameters:
    product     - (product) required
    index       - (number) loop index, used to vary the fallback tone
    reveal      - (boolean) add scroll-reveal animation class (default true)
    show_badge  - (boolean) show the "Made in France" badge (default true)
    sizes       - (string) responsive sizes attribute
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign tones = 'tone-grege,tone-ivoire,tone-sauge,tone-denim,tone-rose,tone-marron-glace,tone-bleu,tone-stone' | split: ','
  assign i = index | default: 0
  assign mod = i | modulo: 8
  assign tone = tones[mod] | default: 'tone-grege'

  assign brand = product.vendor | default: ''
  assign coll_name = product.metafields.custom.collection_name | default: product.type

  assign reveal_class = ''
  unless reveal == false
    assign reveal_class = 'reveal'
  endunless

  assign show_badge_final = true
  if show_badge == false
    assign show_badge_final = false
  endif
  if product.metafields.custom.made_in_france == false
    assign show_badge_final = false
  endif

  assign img_alt = product.images[1]
  assign is_lingerie = false
  comment
    Le Manoir à Lingerie : on garde uniquement l'image de base (la 2e photo
    provoque des bugs d'affichage) + fond blanc (photos sur fond blanc).
  endcomment
  for c in product.collections
    if c.handle == 'le-manoir-a-lingerie'
      assign img_alt = null
      assign is_lingerie = true
    endif
  endfor
-%}
<a class="product-card {{ reveal_class }}" href="{{ product.url }}">
  <div class="media {{ tone }}{% if is_lingerie %} media--white{% endif %}">
    {%- render 'image-layers',
        image: product.featured_image,
        image_alt: img_alt,
        alt: product.title,
        sizes: sizes -%}
    {%- if show_badge_final -%}
      <span class="badge-mif"><span class="tri" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ 'general.made_in_france' | t }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  {%- if brand != blank -%}<p class="product-card__brand">{{ brand }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  <h3 class="product-card__name">{{ product.title }}</h3>
  <div class="product-card__meta">
    {%- if coll_name != blank -%}<span class="product-card__collection">{{ coll_name }}</span>{%- else -%}<span></span>{%- endif -%}
    <span class="price">
      {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
        <span class="price--on-sale"><s>{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {{ product.price | money }}</span>
      {%- else -%}
        {{ product.price | money }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>
  </div>
</a>
